/**
 * Signs a user in and sets the session cookie.
 *
 * Owner D. Runs before any tenant is known, so it cannot go through
 * `withAction()` — there is no `Actor` to resolve yet. `AuthService.login`
 * charges the per-account rate limit (once — charging it here as well would
 * halve the allowance) to blunt credential stuffing.
 *
 * Must call (do not reimplement): loginSchema, setSessionCookie
